window.products.push({"id":332043,"name":"Ice Cream MUGZ Personal-Size Instant \"Make Your Own\" Mini Ice Cream/Slushy Maker, SNOWY OWL","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41DzTph9WPL._AC_.jpg","description":"Ice cream made from orange juice or chocolate milk? You bet. It's a whole lot of fun (and a healthy treat too) when kids shake it into ice cream with this Snowy Owl Ice Cream Maker! Summertime (or anytime!) fun for kids doesn't get much better than this! No mess and mmmmm' good. Economical, easy, and incredibly delicious fun -- these ice cream making Mugz bring on the smiles.  Kids make lip-smacking results themselves by filling the lower section with ice cubes and salt, then adding juice or chocolate milk or cream to the top section. Shake for 3-4 minutes and the results are sooooo good!! A frothy, cold slushy dessert that is just as fun to make as it is to eat -- and kids take pride in their accomplishment of new skills!  How does the mini ice cream maker work? Ahhh.... a little science. The salt quickly melts the ice, which makes the aluminum plate super-cold, turning the liquid into ice cream, ice milk or sorbet. The included recipe book has all kinds of fun concoctions for kids to try using common household ingredients: banana split smoothies, vanilla coolers, even peanut butter and jelly slushies! These Ice Cream Mugz Personal-Sized Ice Cream Makers have lots of character!  MUGZ Ice Cream Maker: Make your own ice cream slushy dessert! Kid-friendly Mugz make delicious ice cream Inspires creativity, independence, and gross motor skills. Quick and easy. Make ice cream anywhere. Makes approx. 4 Tbsp (2 fl. oz.) of yummy dessert with each use. No batteries required. Ready to eat in only about 3 minutes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41DzTph9WPL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Geospace","source_asin":"B08GV2T219","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-332043","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08GV2T219","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08GV2T219","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
