window.products.push({"id":332047,"name":"Halloween Party Decoration Supplies Backdrop Favors for Indoor Decor, Happy Halloween Banner, Pumpkin Lantern, Balloon, Ceiling Hanging Swirls","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71afGRHA+LL._AC_SL1050_.jpg","description":"This Halloween decoration set contains everything you need to decorate a Halloween party. Add ambiance to the Halloween by using this decoration set. Package Includes: 1x Happy Birthday Banner 2x 8\" Grey Lantern 2x 8\" Orange Lantern 2x 8\" Orange Pom Poms 2x 8\" Black Pom Poms 6x Hanging Swirls 8x 12\" Orange Latex Balloons 8x 12\" Black Latex Balloons 8x 12\" Purple Latex Balloons 2x 18\" Pumpkin Foil Balloons 2x 18\" Spider Foil Balloons Why Helium balloons deflate so quick? Because helium atoms are small enough to slip between spaces in the balloon material.  There is less space between the molecules in Mylar, so the balloon stays inflated longer. How long will balloons float? Research shows average float time is 5-7 hours.  Float time can vary significantly based on the level of inflation,size of balloon, temperature and altitude.  We recommend inflating balloons  1-2 hours prior to the event for the best results. What can I do to make latex balloons float longer? First, be sure to tie a tight knot in the neck of the balloon.   If you are attaching ribbons to the balloons, be sure to tie the ribbon below the knot.   For special occasions that require prolonged float time, you can also purchase float extender like ULTRA HI-FLOAT to expend float time to 1 week.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71afGRHA+LL._AC_SL1050_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Brillex","source_asin":"B07WG6WRKS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-332047","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WG6WRKS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WG6WRKS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
