window.products.push({"id":332160,"name":"Carbon Filter with Pad Size: 23\" H x 7\" W x 7\" D","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612phxaERGL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"1863 Earth Worth 4 Inch Filter Size: 23\" H x 7\" W x 7\" D Features: -What makes the earth worth carbon filter so special? Quality and dependability. Earth worth engineers have selected only finest quality materials to make this the best carbon filter on the market. Carbon filters, in conjunction with our inline fans help purify the air in your growing environment and prevent build-up of moisture and odors. For most purposes your carbon filter should be hung horizontally at the top of your growing tent or room and be connected to your fan ducting the air to the outside. Since warm air containing particles will rise, drawing it into the filter at the top of your indoor garden and then venting it outside will be most efficient. You can also use your filter with a fan connected to the lights which will help cool the lights as well. Features: Charcoal carbon filter scrubs odor particles and purifies air. High quality white cotton filter pad. Carbon filters should be replaced approximately every 6 months depending on use.. -Safe and effective operation. -4\" Flange for 23\" size. -6\" Flange for 25.25\" size. -Activated carbon charcoal filter. -Maintenance free design. Dimensions: Size 25.25\" H x 8.75\" W x 8.75\" D - Overall Height - Top to Bottom: -25.25\". Size 25.25\" H x 8.75\" W x 8.75\" D - Overall Depth - Front to Back: -8.75\". Size 25.25\" H x 8.75\" W x 8.75\" D - Overall Product Weight: -23 lbs. Size 23\" H x 7\" W x 7\" D - Overall Height - Top to Bottom: -23\". Size 23\" H x 7\" W x 7\" D - Overall Depth - Front to Back: -7\". Size 23\" H x 7\" W x 7\" D - Overall Product Weight: -14 lbs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612phxaERGL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Earth Worth","source_asin":"B005UNJV0M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-332160","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005UNJV0M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B005UNJV0M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
