window.products.push({"id":332211,"name":"Creative Splash Coffee Sign Keep Calm The Coffee's On | All Coffee Lovers | 9 inch x 12 inch Rigid PVC Coffee Sign | Predrilled Hole | for Kitchen, Ca","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91ADG8dsdkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"KEEP CALM THE COFFE'S ON SIGN Let your customers and guests know you're the place to get a mean cup o' joe! Fun signs for wall decor in coffee house, pub, home coffee bar or any coffee fan. RIGID, STRONG, DURABLE PVC 1/8\" thick commercial grade PVC material is great for indoor or outdoor use. Weather tested coroplast and wood alternative stands up to wear & tear. PERFECT SIZE 12 inches high x 9 inches wide! Perfect touch for a personalized look for your wall coffee decoration! Also makes a great gift for any coffee lover. RICH COLOR PRINTING Bright, vibrant color and printed 3D bevel effect. Cute design adds a clean and fun style touch to any atmosphere! EASY TO INSTALL, MADE IN THE USA Just hang using the predrilled hole! It's super fast & easy!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91ADG8dsdkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Creative Splash","source_asin":"B07NLBV6XW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-332211","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07NLBV6XW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07NLBV6XW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":332212,"name":"IYUEGO Classic Beige Curtain Solid Room Darkening Grommet Top Curtain Drapery Embossed Curtain with Multi Size Customs 100\" W x 96\" L (Set of 1)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FswvhjwoL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"TOP CONSTRUCTION GUIDE: For Grommet, the inside diameter of Grommet is 1.6\", around 6-8 grommets in a 40 inches wide curtain. The grommet ring is nickel in silver. For Tab top, the height of tab is 4\" (10cm). There are about 6-8 tabs in a 40 inch wide curtain.For Rod Pocket, come with 2\" header, and the height of pocket is 3\" (8cm) to ensure the rod could pass through.For the Double Pleated, there are around 6-8 pleats AND firm plastic hooks in a 40 inches wide curtain. Come with firm plastic hooks.If say the width is 84 inches in the size list, for double pleated, that means the panel width at the top with 6-8 pleats already set in the panel. MEASUREMENT INSTRUCTION: For grommet and tab top curtain, measure the drop from the top of pole to where you want curtain to finish.For Pleated top construction, measure the distance from the eye where the curtain hooks attched to where you want your curtan to finish.For rod pocket, measure the distance from the top of pole to where you want curtain to finish. Curtain Width: We suggest You choose a curtain width 2 times wider than the width of the pole or tacck to create folds. For example, if the pole or track is 42 inches, then select a curtain width of 84 inches or 2 panels 42 inches each. Top Construction: Grommet Top Features: Room Darkening Color: As Per Picture Fabric Type: Polyester Crafts: Embossed Solid Fabric Weight: 250 gram/square meter ( Medium ) Includes: 1 Panel Care Instruction: Machine Wash, Do not Bleach, Warm Iron","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FswvhjwoL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"IYUEGO","source_asin":"B00ZZR666A","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-332212","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00ZZR666A","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00ZZR666A","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
