window.products.push({"id":332236,"name":"COZCOT Twin Size Cotton Duvet Cover - 100% Organic Cotton, GOTS Certified, Premium 300 Thread Count Soft Twill Weave, Bottom Ties Closure, Durable and","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ghXU8d9cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% COTTON DUVET COVER. 100% Cotton Twill Weave Duvet Cover brings the softness and durability to your bed. Surprised by its silky, smooth and soft texture, feels like sleeping on a premium hotel bed. Using high quality selected Long-Staple Cotton yarns, makes it outstanding in Twill 300 TC sheets. Variable colors available to match with your duvet, comforter in White, Navy Blue, Pink, Olive Green, Magic Grey, Red, Khaki. THE BEST FIT FOR TWIN OR TWINXL SIZE DUVET OR COMFORTER: Our duvet cover features with thick edged hemmed design; luxurious look gives your room a brand-new look. The bottom ties’ design secures your duvets or comforter stay tucked in, and won’t slip away. The 1-piece twin, twinxl duvet cover include 1 duvet cover (73’’ W x 96’’ L). QUALITY CERTIFIED COTTON SHEETS FOR YOUR SAFETY: We source pure organic cotton that is grown naturally without any chemicals or harmful substance. Unlike microfiber and other types of linen, cotton is better for the environment, keeps you warm and cozy, and keeps you comfortable. Moreover, the STANDARD 100 by OEKO-TEX certification, and GOTS certification ensures that our cotton sheets are free from harmful dyes and chemicals, making them safe for you and your family and your kids to use at home. EASY TO CARE: Our top-rated cotton duvet covers are machine washable and don't fade when washed since they are made with the best quality dyes. Additionally, they do not pill or shrink easily. Compared to silk, which require expert maintenance, Twill sheet is more robust, affordable, and lasting. Give the duvet cover a few washes to achieve its smoothness as cotton softens with washing. We advise washing it first if you are sensitive skin. BUY WITH CONFIDENCE - Our Twill duvet covers are some of the softest Twill duvet cover you can find online, they are backed by incredible customer service to make sure your satisfaction is guaranteed. If you don’t like our duvet cover, you can return them for a refund or replacement as per Amazon guidelines, no question asked.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ghXU8d9cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"COZCOT","source_asin":"B09XDHWBDQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-332236","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XDHWBDQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XDHWBDQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":332237,"name":"Duck River Textiles - Metallico Faux Linen Metallic Textured Grommet Top Window Curtains for Living Room & Bedroom - Assorted Colors - Set of 2 Panels","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61khXtr7WaL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"Product Description SHOP WITH CONFIDENCE: We bring unique, whimsical, inspirational, home solution products to our Happy Customers For Over 25 Years ! - (#1) Two window curtain panels. Measures: 40\"W by 84\"L per curtain (80\"W by 84\"L both curtain) (#2) Long lasting. Energy efficient. Thermal insulated. Noise reducing & Privacy protecting (#3) Various pattern colors available for accurate purchase, please click color button to see detailed reference (#4) Machine washable and Dryable for easy care. No shrinkage. No color fading. No unravelling after washing From the Manufacturer Duck River Textile, Inc. was founded twenty years ago by the Cohen Brothers; Oury, Eili, Raymond, and Joseph. They started out in a 30,000 square foot factory, buying fabrics from the U.S. Mills, producing Sheets, window and Shower Curtains. They have a 75 year family history in Textiles, going back to their Grandfather, who had his own Spinning and Weaving Mill overseas. He taught his grandsons all about Fabrics and Techniques which they still use until today. Fifteen years ago, as the U.S. Mills started shutting down one by one. The Cohen Brothers were one of the first who had the foresight to move their factory overseas. They created partnerships and joint ventures in China, which still exist today. They continue to reinvest and capitalize their partnerships, giving them and their factories a leading edge in the market place, with new Production capabilities, Machinery, Innovative Techniques, and Fashion Design. Duck River has been praised and recognized by many in the industry for their foresight, on time deliveries, and Fashion Forward thinking. Today our Private Label business and Direct POE orders account for 40 percent of our growing business.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61khXtr7WaL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Duck River Textiles","source_asin":"B08SW46FJX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-332237","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08SW46FJX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08SW46FJX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
