window.products.push({"id":332252,"name":"HealthyLine Noil Silk Natural Summer Comforter - Light Weight Soft - 200 GSM in 100% Cotton Satin - Breathable Quilt (Full, 200GSM)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81uQMlL2bOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HealthyLine 100% Natural Pure Wild Silk Filled Summer Comforter Light Weight – 100 GSM/200 GSM in 100% Cotton-Satin 60S HealthyLine premium silk comforters are the ideal choice when it comes to all-season use and breathability. You get a durable piece of bedding that keeps you warm, but at the same time doesn’t cause you to sweat on warm nights. Silk filling comforter is enough to elevate your sleeping conditions to the next level to ensure that you are always getting a peaceful and rejuvenating night’s rest.   HealthyLine 100% Natura Noil Silk Comforter When deciding between our different silk comforters, you will find that Noil checks all the boxes for a luxury experience. Noil silk, or as it is often called “raw silk,” is the byproduct of spinning silk. These leftover fibers look more like cotton than they do silk, but in comparison, they produce a superior texture and depth ideal for weaving into textiles, clothing, and bedding material. In terms of silk, Noil is a cost-effective option that provides many of the same benefits at less of an investment. Like all of HealthyLine silk comforters, the Noil silk comforter is lightweight, breathable, and durable making it best for warmer weather and long-term use. Specification Approx. weight: up to 6 lbs (3 kg) King size: 98″ x 89″ (250 cm x 225 cm) Queen size: 89″ x 89″ (225 cm x 225 cm) Full size: 89″ x 67″ (225 cm x 170 cm) Filling: 100% Natural Pure Wild (Noil) Silk Grams per Square Meter: 100 GSM / 200 GSM Fabric cover: 100% Cotton-Satin 60S (300TC) Color: White 4 Corner Tabs","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81uQMlL2bOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HealthyLine","source_asin":"B07MTSSGH9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-332252","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MTSSGH9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MTSSGH9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
