window.products.push({"id":332320,"name":"2pc New Queen/Standard Size Or King Size Silk~y Satin Pillow Case Multiple Colors by Orly's Dream. (King, Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gbuJI7wmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"- 2pc New Satin Pillow Case - 100% Satin - Has Silky Smooth Texture - Machine Washable (do not machine dry, but hang dry!) - Reduces Hair Breakage - Maintains Moisture Balance in Hair and Skin - Will ship via USPS, Tracking Number Included - The package contains: - 2 Silk~y Satin 100% Polyester Pillow cases, It is a regular open end bag-style pillowcase. - Fabric Content: 100% polyester, (Not real silk, the fabric is 100% Polyester). - Care Instructions: Machine Wash cold water, Tumble Dry Low, No Dryer Please. - List of colors available: Burgundy/Red, Purple/Lavender, Navy Blue, Beige/Bone, White, Pink, Gold/Bronze, Black, Silver, Brown, Sky Blue, Teal, Copper Brown & Sage Green.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gbuJI7wmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Orly'sDream","source_asin":"B01ND090Q7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-332320","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01ND090Q7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01ND090Q7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":332321,"name":"CASABREWS Espresso Machine 20 Bar, Compact Cappuccino Machine with Automatic Milk Frother, Stainless Steel Espresso Maker With 49 oz Removable Water T","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":199.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bAjhaKOrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"☕【Make Your Favorite Espresso Beverages At Home】: The CASABREWS coffee maker with milk frother allows you to prepare all your favorite espresso-based drinks. You can enjoy a barista-quality latte, cappuccino or macchiato at home. Stainless steel appearance, stylish and durable, ideal for any size kitchen. This compact espresso coffee maker is not only perfect for home or office use, but also makes a great wedding gift, birthday gift, christmas gift, gift for mom, gift for dad or gift for wife. ☕【Compact & User Friendly】: The small espresso machine takes up only a little space on your countertop so it is ideal for small kitchens. The 49 oz transparent water tank is detachable and easy to fill. The drip tray lifts out for easy rinsing. The brushed stainless steel is durable and a timeless design that looks beautiful in any kitchen. Included components: Espresso Machine* 1, Milk Frother*1, Water Tank*1, One-Cup Filter*1, Two-Cup Filter*1, 51mm Portafilter*1, Tamper*1, Coffee Spoon*1. ☕【Professional 20-Bar Pressure System】: Semi-Automatic 2-in-1 Espresso Maker, with 20-bar professional Italian pump and 1350W powerful motor. This latte machine gives you top quality extraction, resulting in a more fragrant and rich aroma. The built-in pressure gauge on this cappuccino machine shows the exact pressure, allowing you to adjust to your personal taste preferences. You can make cappuccinos, lattes or flat whites in your home or office with our cappuccino maker. ☕【Automatic Milk Frother】: Our espresso machine is equipped with a built-in milk frother. It can be used to make a variety of beverages, including espresso, cappuccinos, or lattes. Automatic milk frother whips any milk into a light, creamy froth. Customize milk-based espresso with the touch of a button. Note: 1. Before making cappuccino or latte, please try purge out any residual water from milk frothing tube. 2. Run a initial self-cleaning process after making cappuccino or latte. ☕【Full Stainless Steel Design】: With full stainless steel appearance, our espresso coffee machine is more beautiful and durable than other plastic espresso machines. We also provide 1-Year Warranty. If we can be of assistance in any way, please don't hesitate to contact us. ☕【Useful Tips】: Too coarse a grind, too little coffee, or insufficiently tamping the grounds before brewing can all lead to inadequate pressure for a proper brew. To prevent the milk frother from being clogged with milk, you must press the latte button for 5s to run a cleaning cycle after making cappuccino, latte or milk foam. This operation is mainly to remove the residual milk in the milk frother, prevent the milk frother from being blocked by the dried milk. ☕【Water Shortage Reminder Function】: Please remove the rubber plug at the bottom of the water tank before using this coffee maker. This machine equipped with water shortage reminder function. The lights on all the buttons will turn green to remind you that the water tank is short of water. Just follow the steps of included guide or the operation in instructional video to stop the this reminder. You can watch more INSTRUCTIONAL VIDEO by clicking Visit the CASABREWS Store.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bAjhaKOrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CASABREWS","source_asin":"B0BS3LVWF6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-332321","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BS3LVWF6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BS3LVWF6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":332322,"name":"Euro-Pro TO282 4-Slice Toaster Oven","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41F7PRRDVAL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product description 1,000-watt, 4-slice capacity toaster oven with 4 main heating options. Convenient 15-minute timer with bell and stay-on function. Includes chrome-plated wire rack, baking tray, and tongs. Measures 16-1/2\" x 12-1/5\" x 11-1/5\". Brushed stainless exterior. Easy-to-clean interior. Cool-touch handle. Amazon.com More versatile than a toaster, this toaster oven not only browns bread but can cook smaller quantities of food, such as baked potatoes or a few helpings of lasagna, without requiring you to use your main oven. The 1,000-watt toaster oven fits about four bagels or slices of bread and offers two different positions for its rack, depending on whether you prefer to toast or broil. In addition to baking or broiling options, the control panel offers a warming alternative and a setting for toasting and reheating pizza (which never turns out right in the microwave). The timer can be set for up to 15 minutes of cooking and a bell alerts you when time is up. You may also override the timer and set the power to the \"stay on\" position. The toaster oven has an easy-to-clean interior with a removable crumb tray and a handsome brushed stainless-steel exterior with a cool-touch handle on the door. Accessories that come with this toaster oven include a chrome-plated wire rack, a baking tray, and tongs for removing the tray without burning your hands. --Cristina Vaamonde","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41F7PRRDVAL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ninja","source_asin":"B000070IBW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-332322","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000070IBW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000070IBW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
