window.products.push({"id":332411,"name":"VOLCANOES CLUB Small Stainless Steel Snack Containers with Silicone Lids, Set of 4 (13oz, 7oz, 3oz, 1.5oz), Metal Kids Lunch Containers Bento Box, Lea","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZY+3NQohL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[100% FOOD-GRADE MATERIALS]: These Containers do not have any plastic content whatsoever and are made of “SUS 304” stainless steel (18/8 stainless steel), an excellent material for kitchen products to keep them durable and rust resistant. The lids are made of high quality and food grade silicone that is completely free of BPA, non-toxic, has no chemical odor and still provides a very soft silicone feel as well as a nice fit on the Containers. [100% LEAKPROOF]: The soft, flexible silicone lids seal incredibly well and are easily opened and closed! You can even throw these in your lunch bag or backpack without having to worry about any leaks. [DISHWASHER & FREEZER SAFE]: These Food Containers are easily cleaned by hand or in the dishwasher. They’re also safe to be kept in the refrigerator. Thanks to the air tight seal, your food stays fresh longer than other storage containers. Note: Please avoid microwaving them since they’re made of metal. [CONPACT & PORTION CONTROL]:1.5oz/50ml; 3oz/ 100ml; 7oz/ 200ml; 12oz/ 400ml. Portable, reusable, and lightweight lunch boxes, they’re just perfect for controlling all portions of your salad, fruit, snacks,nuts or vegetable dips. Wide usage in the kitchen, school, office, during picnic, travel, camp, on the beach etc. [GREAT GIFT FOR MEAL-PREPPER]: These Stackable Reusable Small Containers can be use as many times as you'd like. You can use them to prepare anything you want. That must be a perfect gift choice for meal-prepper. BETTER THAN GLASS: Lightweight& Durable; they’re much lighter than glass and don’t break when dropped. BETTER THAN PLASTIC: Eco-friendly, reusable, no plastic smell and doesn’t contain anything harmful that are normally present in plastic. 100% SATISFATORY SERVICE: If the small snack container set you received is damaged or imperfect, or you are not 100% satisfied, please contact us directly and we will provide a satisfactory solution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZY+3NQohL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VOLCANOES CLUB","source_asin":"B0BP6TPCPS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-332411","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BP6TPCPS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BP6TPCPS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
