window.products.push({"id":332459,"name":"O-Mido Shower Caddy Corner, Rustproof Corner Shower Caddy Shelf, Wall Mounted Shampoo Conditioner Organizer Holder w/Built-in 4 Hooks for Bathroom Kit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81wBOEc0YxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% stainless steel stainless steel O-Mido Shower Caddy Corner, Adhesive Shower Caddy basket, 304 Stainless Steel Hanging Organizer, Wall Mounted Shower Shelf w/ Built-in 4 Hooks for Bathroom Kitchen Dorm, Rustproof, Silver, 2 Pack Adhesive Shower Shelf is a popular solution for mess shower bathroom, it will help you find your facial cleanser so easily. Robust Capacity for Your Organization You can easily store 4-6 bottles of foam or liquid on the shower caddy. Each shower shelf can withstand up to 20 lbs. Put bath or kitchen supplies on the shower shelf now. Start to enjoy your neat & Spacious space. Easy Installation without Tools Compared with the suction cup, our corner shower caddy can be installed without any tools, thanks to the stunning adhesives, no drilling or damage to your wall any more. With the invisible transparent sticker design, the shower shelf is suitable for a variety of interior decoration styles. Easy to Use, Easy to Remove How to use: 1. Clean the surface and make sure the surface is smooth, dry, flat & clean. 2. Tear off the back film of adhesive, stick the adhesives to the cleaned surface.  3. Lock the caddy to the position, pull the shelf down, squeeze the shelf into groove. QUALITY YOU CAN COUNT ON:if you are not 100% satisfied with this Corner shower caddy,please contact us at any time for a refund. How to remove: If you need to tear off installed adhesive, use a hair dryer to heat adhesive surface, then tear it off.  Please note the adhesive is NOT reusable. If you want to change install place, you can purchase more adhesive. Kindly Remind: 1. Only stick the shower caddy on smooth hard and flat surfaces. 2. Please DO NOT stick the shelf on painted walls or wallpapers as it will take off your paint or wallpapers. Original Backend KWS: shower caddy corner basket hanging suction cup adhesive bathroom bamboo mesh standing over the door wall bag dorm college black brown silver shower organizer stick on stainless steel bath shelf large adjustable metal mesh stand up sticky rustproof New kws: corner shower caddy bathroom shower organizer corner shower shelves shower basket shower storage shower rack shower shelf for inside shower caddy suction cup adhesive wall mounted kitchen spice holder rustproof for shampoo","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81wBOEc0YxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"O-Mido","source_asin":"B0B28W47Z7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-332459","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B28W47Z7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B28W47Z7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
