window.products.push({"id":332588,"name":"Biltek Smart Blinds for Windows Light Filtering Shades Motorized Roller Blinds & Shades Cordless Window Blinds Electric Blinds with Remote Automatic W","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":145.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/9194BrTtqpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[ SMART HOME AUTOMATION ] Automate Your Home With Our Motorized Blinds! Easily Raise/Lower Your Shades With a Push of a Button! Unlock More Functions and Features With the Purchase of Our Smart Hub (Sold Separately) - Connect to Alexa and Google Home and Enjoy Multiple Home Automations- Voice Control, App Control, Scheduled Timers, and a Lot More Smart Device Features! One Hub Can Connect Up to 20 Blinds. Max Distance Between Hub and Blind is 40 Meters. A Smart Purchase for an Even Smarter Home! [ CONVENIENT ] Electric Blinds Automate an Unnecessarily Tedious Repetitive Task (Sometimes in Hard-To-Reach Areas). Maximize Your Home's Lighting Efficiency By Scheduling the Blinds To Open During the Day and Close During the Night. Simplify Your Life by Easily Adjusting these RoHS-Certified Cordless Blinds When Ready to Sleep, Reduce Annoying TV Glare, or to Just Get Some Privacy While You Relax from a Hard Day. [ LONG BATTERY LIFE ] The Motorized Blinds Come with a Rechargeable Battery That Lasts Up to 6 Months Before Requiring a Recharge! The Batteries are Upgraded with a Longer Life as They Hold 20% More Charge than Other Motors. The 100-240V Input Voltage Battery Only Takes 2 Hours to Fully Recharge. Integrated Rechargeable Batteries Save You Time and Money Instead of Having to Constantly Replace Old Empty Batteries! [ EASY CONTROL ] Our Motorized Shades have a Modern Cordless Design that Combines Elegance with Functionality! Precise Remote Control Lets You Freely Raise, Lower, and Stop the Blinds at the Exact Position You Want. The 6-Channel Remote Allows You to Connect Up to 6 Separate Smart Blinds. You Can Either Control Each Blind Individually or You Can Control All 6 At Once! Control the Blinds From Anywhere in Your House Even While Working, Cooking, Exercising, Cleaning and Other Activities! [ FAST SHIPPING, 1-YEAR WARRANTY ] All Available Sizes are Ready to Ship As Soon As You Order (Ships On the Same Day if You Order Before 12pm EST). We Offer an Included 1 Year Warranty*! If You Have any Questions, Feel Free to Contact Us by Phone or Email! We Are More Than Happy to Help!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/9194BrTtqpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Biltek","source_asin":"B0BCC522W5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-332588","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BCC522W5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BCC522W5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
