window.products.push({"id":332630,"name":"EASELAND Large Power Lift Recliner Chair with Massage and Heat for Elderly, Oversized Wide Recliners with Overstuffed Seat,Faux Breathable Leather wit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":579.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YlKwbvTmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Enlarged and Widened Design】 By analyzing the tall features of the American human body, we have designed an enlarged and widened electric lift reclining chair that is suitable for most Americans. The 33.5\" wide backrest and 22.4\" seat depth provide the perfect support for your body and enjoy the comfort it brings to you. 【Electric Lift Assist】We use high-quality motor, UL certified silent lift motor with good performance and longer service life. The lift chair is driven by an electric mechanism, which pushes the whole chair up to help the elderly, pregnant women, etc. stand easily, suitable for living rooms, bedrooms and offices. 【Vibrating Massage & Thermostatic Heating】: Power lift recliner comes with 8 vibration nodes on back, lumbar, thigh and leg; 5 vibration modes (pulse, press, wave, auto and normal) with 3 intensities from low to high. One heating system on lumbar area;temperature controlled heating, the temperature is 113℉~140℉, when it reaches 140℉, it will automatically cut off the power, and continue to cool to 113℉ before heating. 【Strong Durable and Easy to Clean】Compared with linen material, pu leather is softer, stain resistant, easier to clean and more breathable. The backrest, seat cushion and armrests are filled with high density foam to provide you with the ultimate comfort and support. High load-bearing alloy stand, strong and durable, can hold up to 300 lbs. 【Convenient Design】Thoughtful storage space (2 side pockets, 2 cup holders) and USB charging port, you can store remote control, cups and other small items, and charge your low power devices. Our chair lifts can recline up to 160 degrees and can be smoothly adjusted to your preferred lift or recline position with just the push of two buttons on the armrest, making it easy to operate for all ages. 【Easy to Assemble】The chairs come in 2 boxes, we ship on the same day, but the carrier may deliver on a different day. If you have any problems, you can contact us promptly and we will respond within 24 hours. No tools required:Set up in about 10 minutes, just snap the 2 armrests and 1 backrest into the base separately. 【Warranty Policy】 Quality problems caused by non-human causes: 30 days free return, 180 days free exchange and 3-years warranty guarantee. How to contact us? STEPS: Login your amazon account> choose \"Your orders\"> find the order ID> click\" Contact seller\".EASELAND provide helpful, prompt and friendly customer service at your disposal.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YlKwbvTmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EASELAND","source_asin":"B0BSRQKVLC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-332630","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BSRQKVLC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BSRQKVLC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
