window.products.push({"id":332648,"name":"Amy Garden Cooling Weighted Blanket, 15lbs Adult Heavy Blanket (48''×72'', Light Grey), Breathable Weighted Blanket with Premium Glass Beads, Comforta","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JgjNzxX0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Comfortable Deep Sleep：Amy Garden weighted blanket simulates the feeling of being hugged through the weight of the blanket itself, which makes you feel sleeping in a warm embrace, relaxes your body, relieves your fatigue, and allows you to have a better sleep. 7-layer Structure Design：The weighted blanket adopts a 7-layer structure design, which perfectly realizes the dual experience of good air permeability and good coolness. We have been working hard to improve the quality of the blanket and have done a lot of updates to it, through sophisticated sewing technology, there is no risk of penetration so that the glass beads are evenly distributed in the blanket, perfectly covering the contours of your body, giving you a comfortable experience. How to Choose: Choose the weight of your blanket based on 7% - 15% of your body weight, the 15lb weighted blanket is suitable for people weighing 120-180lb, and the size of 48 \"× 72\" is suitable for a single bed. Perfect Gift Choice: Amy garden weighted blanket is a perfect sleep gift. No matter in any festival or on any occasion, it can be given to your lover, relatives or friends. Give them our weighted blanket and let them have a better sleep. Instruction: The heavy inner layer and the duvet cover are sold separately! We suggest you buy a blanket together with a duvet cover, so when you want to wash it, you can just need to take the cover off for a quick wash and dry. Pregnant women, infants, and patients are not allowed to use. People with weak bodies should choose lighter blankets.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JgjNzxX0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Amy Garden","source_asin":"B07TL8LMM9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-332648","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TL8LMM9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TL8LMM9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
