window.products.push({"id":332695,"name":"Pfaltzgraff Jaxon 16 Piece Dinnerware Set, Service For 4, Multicolor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":85.87,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81LutzAy0IS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Stunningly unique and contemporary, this Pfaltzgraff 16-Piece Jaxon Dinneware Set brings modern sophistication to your tabletop. As if morphing from the light of day to the dark of night, each piece in the collection moves from bright white to a band of deepening blue before arriving at charcoal black. Striated lines encircle each piece, and a distinct speckle effect is enhanced by a reactive glaze finish. Dinnerware is made from high-quality stoneware for long-lasting beauty and durability. Note that due to the nature of reactive glaze, no two pieces are exactly alike and will exhibit unique variations in color and pattern. 16-piece set, service for 4, includes 4 each of: 10-inch dinner plate, 8-1/2 inch salad plate, 6-inch diameter soup/cereal bowl, and 12-fluid ounce mug. Microwave and dishwasher safe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81LutzAy0IS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pfaltzgraff","source_asin":"B0B1SPYT52","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-332695","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B1SPYT52","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B1SPYT52","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
