window.products.push({"id":332802,"name":"Zendori Desk Decor Art Live Laugh Love Desk Plaque Decor - Inspirational French Country Decorative Signs for Family (Wood Art, 6\"x9\")","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610hN4adnZL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"ABOUT THIS PIECE A touch of warm yellow tone, a little rustic feel and a very welcoming message \"Live Laugh Love\" are how this French country art brings your home to life.  Live fully this life because it's the only one you have. Express yourself to the world. Laugh often because it is contagious, and the world needs happiness. It also warms your soul and makes you feel better. Love unconditionally because love is everything. That's the 3 L rule that every home should have. Zendori Art—the Art of Mindful Living was born out of a passion from a husband and wife team from Atlanta, Georgia  who wanted to create art that is meaningful and impactful, art that can make a positive difference in people’s lives;  pieces that are not only beautiful but also inspirational, art that talks. Message displayed says: \"Live Every Moment, Laugh Every Day, Love Beyond Words\", perfectly summing up what life should be. This poster reminds us to (1) Live - because life is too short (2) Laugh - because it is the best medicine and it is contagious and  (3) Love - because it is the sweetest thing that can happen to you! This inspirational office or home decor is a great way to keep positive and a beautiful reminder of what is essential in life. The uplifting messages on this piece will surely leave you feeling good each time you look at it. . This is an ORIGINAL and AUTHENTIC piece made in the USA. It is also available as Poster on Canvas Paper (please scroll up to change Material Type). It will be a great addition to your other inspirational pieces at home, school or office. Grab this beautiful wood art for you or send it as a gift! Add to cart while stock lasts!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610hN4adnZL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zendori","source_asin":"B01K7TELPS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-332802","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01K7TELPS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01K7TELPS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
