window.products.push({"id":332861,"name":"Giantex Electric Heated Blanket, 84\" x 90\" Queen Size Flannel Electric Blanket Throws, 10 Heating Levels, 8 Hours Auto Off, Fast Heating ETL Certifica","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":85.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OtQllHlfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Warm & Soft Material]: Made of super-cozy flannel, this 84\" x 90\" high-quality electric blanket can cover your full body and help you relax each inch of your aching muscles and joints. Plus, it has denser heating coils, which makes it heat more evenly and give users warm using experience in cold weather. [10 Heating Levels]: Our electric blanket can heat up in seconds to reach your desired temperature. In order to meet different requirements, we have carefully designed 10 temperature levels (ranging from 84 - 108°F) on the handy control panel, perfect for napping on the sofa or bed. [Auto-Off Protection & Timing Function]: Electric blanket is specifically designed with 8 hours auto-off protection, which saves energy and prevents over-heating. Additionally, 1-12 hours timing function makes you falling asleep freely and leaves you peace of mind. And ETL certification ensures its high quality and long service life. [Durable & Machine Washable]: Because of the detachable controller and power cord, the electric blanket pad can keep hygiene and softness no matter how many times you have washed it within many years. In addition, you can not only wash it by hand but also clean it by washing machine. [Wide Range of Applications]: 5.7ft power cable makes our electric blanket work flexibly anywhere, such as in bedroom, living room and office. Apart from that,  the blanket provides incredible comfort while working efficiently to preserve heat with excellent heat penetration and preservation, perfect for users of different ages.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OtQllHlfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Giantex","source_asin":"B08SBNT554","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-332861","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08SBNT554","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08SBNT554","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":332862,"name":"Santa Barbara Design Studio Tamara Hensick Tiny Pewter Kitty Figurine, Love","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41-EALIGSDL._AC_.jpg","description":"At Santa Barbara Design Studio, our passion for finding the next wonderful product has translated into a broad line drawn from the works of talented and trendsetting designers like Tamara Hensick, whose clever wordplay and symbolism blend magically with pewter sculpture to create inspirational themes for the special or everyday times in our lives. Express exactly what you'd like to say when a friend needs cheering up, when you need a boost of inspiration, when you want to encourage someone to stay strong, or congratulate them on celebrating a rite of passage such as a graduation, a new job, or a new family member. Not dainty and fragile, these \"charms\" compel you to pick them up, to squeeze them in your hand or keep them in your pocket while pondering affirmations, inspirations and goals brought on by the words or phrases etched into them. While spoken words may be forgotten, an object can be a constant reminder to believe in our own wishes, hopes and dreams. Tamara's collection of accessories and trinkets reflect everyday sayings and symbols, all with a refreshing twist of whimsy. Each and every design is originally hand sculpted in soft wax and the resulting endearing shape complete with its own little imperfections gives every keepsake its very own special character. Place one on a shelf, your desk, a computer, in a plant pot or keep one in your purse or pocket. Hand made in the USA. Due to the nature of hand-cast pewter sculpture, you may see slight color variations in the product photography.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41-EALIGSDL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Santa Barbara Design Studio","source_asin":"B00CI7GDXG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-332862","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00CI7GDXG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00CI7GDXG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
