window.products.push({"id":332968,"name":"BAMBOO PANDA Reusable Travel Coffee Mug with Lid – Sustainable & Eco-Friendly Bamboo Fiber Coffee Cup with Removable Anti-Slip Silicone Sleeve – 16oz/","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81YSpscRzhS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Every minute, over one million cups end up in landfills globally and only about 1% of that is recyclable. The remaining 99% will take hundreds of years to degrade. Bamboo Panda cups are designed by keeping that in mind. When buried, BAMBOO PANDA Cups return back to nature without harming the environment. Bamboo is one of the fastest decomposing materials in the world which takes only 4-6 months to decompose completely. Made of organic bamboo fiber (60%), resin, and corn powder (20%), the use of our reusable coffee cup with lid saves the environment around you by cutting down the use of non-biodegradable single-use polystyrene cups. The eco-friendly Bamboo cups are the perfect solution to decrease damage to the environment of our beautiful planet. Our bamboo cup combines beauty, pleasant touch, and environmental safety in one. SMOOTH ERGONOMIC DESIGN The cup mouth is smooth and round and fits the lips conveniently. The silicone sleeve is anti-slip, removable, and thermo-protective. Practical and ergonomic design ensures the perfect grip on the go. The Bamboo Panda coffee cup is definitely a must-have for you! VERSATILE USAGE Bamboo Panda Coffee Cup is great for home, teahouse, restaurant, leisure bar, office, school, and outdoor sports. Take it to fishing, camping, or traveling as it fits easily into bicycle or car cup holders. Perfect for coffee, water, tea, milk, juice. EASY TO USE | CARE INSTRUCTIONS The cup is easy to clean and the dishwasher safe. No hassle, simply pop it into the dishwasher after a long day of use. For the bamboo cups to last longer, it is advised to store them in a well-ventilated area. Don’t forget to remove the sleeve before putting it into the microwave. Contribute towards saving the environment and the wildlife with our BAMBOO PANDA Coffee Mugs. Add to Cart NOW!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81YSpscRzhS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bamboo Panda","source_asin":"B095J5Q6DN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-332968","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B095J5Q6DN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B095J5Q6DN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":332969,"name":"Blu ray DVD Case - Translucent Blue 10 pack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31-I+UqyskL._AC_.jpg","description":"Replace your broken or scratched Blu-ray DVD Boxes & Keep Your Collection Looking Nice! These are the same size as the translucent blue DVD boxes the movies come in when you buy them in the store! These replacement Blu-Ray boxes with full wrap-around sleeve so you have a protected spot to put the DVD insert sheet in! The cases are 12mm thick (slightly thinner than a standard DVD case) and have the Blu-ray logo on the outside at the top. The cases have two clips on the inside to hold additional booklets. This is just like the ones you buy normal Blu-ray DVDs in - so if yours are getting scratched and unpleasant looking, you can switch the paper and disc to these new ones and brighten up your collection!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31-I+UqyskL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Media Supply","source_asin":"B003WGTNLQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-332969","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003WGTNLQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003WGTNLQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
